'''Magma''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance==
The edge of the blade features molten magma, hence the name. To the right of the magma is magma rock, which also makes up the guard and handle.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Magma (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

